region       box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box   2 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (12.4 12.4 12.4)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
mass         1 15.9994
mass         2 1.008
molecule     h2o spcfq.mol
Read molecule template h2o:
# SPC-FQ 3-site water: O(type1) + 2H(type2), all charged via samqeq. SPC geom rOH=1.0 theta=109.47.
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  0 bodies
  3 atoms with max type 2
  0 bonds with max type 0
  0 angles with max type 0
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
create_atoms 0 box mol h2o 12345
Created 192 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (12.4 12.4 12.4)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.002 seconds
group        fq type 1 2
192 atoms in group fq
set          type 1 charge -0.85
Setting atom values ...
  64 settings made for charge
set          type 2 charge  0.425
Setting atom values ...
  128 settings made for charge
pair_style   hybrid/overlay lj/cut 10.0 coul/long 10.0 coul/shield/intra 10.0 all
pair_coeff   1 1 lj/cut 0.01275 3.176
pair_coeff   1 2 lj/cut 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff   2 2 lj/cut 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff   * * coul/long
pair_coeff   * * coul/shield/intra 1.11
pair_modify  pair lj/cut shift yes
kspace_style pppm/samqeq 1.0e-6
neighbor     2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix          chg fq qeq/sam 1 0.0 10.0 1.0e-7 spcfq_expt.param
fix_modify   chg energy yes

compute      dip fq dipole/samqeq
timestep     0.001
velocity     all create 298 123456 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix          integ all rigid/nvt/small molecule temp 298 298 0.1
Fix rigid/nvt/small setup ...
  create bodies CPU = 0.000 seconds
  64 rigid bodies with 192 atoms
  1.0000026 = max distance from body owner to body atom
thermo_style custom step temp pe etotal c_dip
thermo       1000
run          100000

